                <h1>
  Apply to Bachelor&#039;s programmes in Finnish and Swedish</h1>
                                          <div class="aalto-article__ingress">
            
                    Aalto University offers over 30 bachelor&#039;s programmes in Finnish and Swedish in the fields of business and economics, science and technology as well as art and design. You can find information about these programmes in Finnish and Swedish on the Finnish and Swedish versions of this page.
            
          </div>
        
